message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "promptdiff"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-04-29"
url: "https://github.com/vdeshmukh203/promptdiff"
abstract: >-
  A pure-Python library for computing and visualising differences between
  prompt strings.  Provides line-level diff, word-level diff, unified diff
  formatting, and character-bigram cosine similarity.  Includes an optional
  Tkinter graphical interface.
